# [Verified behavior]($section.id('verified-behavior'))

## [Claude retry limits]($section.id('claude-retry-limits'))

### [Claude stops repeating corrections when no work occurs]($section.id('claude-stops-repeating-corrections-when-no-work-occurs').attrs('verified'))

[Claude Code]($text.attrs('agent')) [completion]($text.attrs('tag')) [retry-loop]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L7)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A previously passing Claude watcher now reports warnings](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L363).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [The correction turns repeatedly finish without using tools](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L378).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [Only one correction is requested while completion and publication stay guarded](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L385).

### [Inspecting in a correction turn does not repeat the correction]($section.id('inspecting-in-a-correction-turn-does-not-repeat-the-correction').attrs('verified'))

[Claude Code]($text.attrs('agent')) [completion]($text.attrs('tag')) [retry-loop]($text.attrs('tag')) [inspection]($text.attrs('tag'))
