### [Another process's changes give Claude at most one correction]($section.id('another-processs-changes-give-claude-at-most-one-correction').attrs('verified'))

[Claude Code]($text.attrs('agent')) [completion]($text.attrs('tag')) [retry-loop]($text.attrs('tag')) [outside-changes]($text.attrs('tag'))
[View test](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/catalog.py#L17)

- [Given]($text.attrs('given')) [A Claude session whose checks are clean and which makes no edits](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L401).
- [When]($text.attrs('when')) [Another process changes files several times, so the check fails with a different count each time](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L378).
- [Then]($text.attrs('then')) [The session receives at most one correction, none says the failures came after its latest change, and completion stays guarded](https://github.com/benomahony/overwatch/blob/main/tests/acceptance/world.py#L385).

